This project contains no source code copied from other projects. The Porsche
Connect / PPA API behaviour it relies on (endpoint URLs, the `key` command wire
field, the 201 -> job-poll command flow, and the S-PIN challenge/response hash
sha512(bytes.fromhex(pin + challenge)).hexdigest().upper()) was independently
re-implemented in TypeScript with reference to:

  pyporscheconnectapi  (https://github.com/CJNE/pyporscheconnectapi)
  Copyright (c) 2020 Johan Isacsson
  Licensed under the MIT License.

These are factual/functional API elements (interfaces, methods of operation and
data formats), not literary expression. The MIT text of pyporscheconnectapi is
reproduced below as an acknowledgement of that reference.

